<title>USA: American Exploration Co sets qtly dividend.</title>
<headline>American Exploration Co sets qtly dividend.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1996-12-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>American Exploration Co said on Monday its board of directors declared a regular quarterly dividend of $0.5625 per depositary share, each representing a 1/200 interest in a share of $450 cumulative convertible preferred stock series C.</p>
<p>The company said the dividend will be paid on December 31 to shareholders of record on December 20. The dividend is unchanged from its previous one.</p>
<p>American Exploration, trading down 1/8 at 15-1/4 at midday, is an independent oil and gas company.</p>
</text>
